 "description": "Asteroids and Luke, what a combination.",
 "strategy": "Basically I get luke and short green dude on Dag, and start Luke’s training. While that’s going on wedge, Han, Chewie and Hobbie play force drains and rycar’s run. Once Luke finishes his training, he helps out Obi and Qui force drain at any opponents sites. Gift help them beat down by adding 2 destinies.  Basically drain, and Rycar run, and have fun. Its especially fun to play a Test 6 when your opponent dosen’t have a Vader, because of the 2 lost force a turn, I love to watch annoyance creep onto my opponents face.\n\nAny way tell me what you think.",
